# NiceGUI docs (MCP)

When working on NiceGUI UI under `src/cibmangotree/gui/`, use the `nicegui-docs` MCP server (backed by `docs/nicegui.io/llm.txt`):

1. Call `list_doc_sources` to see the NiceGUI llms.txt source
2. Call `fetch_docs` on that source to read the local reference
3. If a linked `https://nicegui.io/...` page is relevant, call `fetch_docs` on it
4. Prefer that guidance over inventing Quasar/JS/CSS patterns — NiceGUI is Python-first (`ui.*`)
